    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: English
    Text: Of course we do.
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Ukrainian
    Text: "\u0417\u0432\u0456\u0441\u043D\u043E, \u043F\u0440\u0438\u0439\u043C\u0430\u0454\u043C\u043E."
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Spanish
    Text: "Claro que s\xED."
    Object: {fileID: 0}
