    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: English
    Text: Your enthusiasm is making me somewhat uneasy.
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Ukrainian
    Text: "\u041C\u0435\u043D\u0435 \u0442\u0440\u043E\u0445\u0438 \u043B\u044F\u043A\u0430\u0454
      \u0432\u0430\u0448 \u0435\u043D\u0442\u0443\u0437\u0456\u0430\u0437\u043C."
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Spanish
    Text: Su entusiasmo me inquieta un poco.
    Object: {fileID: 0}
