  - Language: English
    Text: Each one has its own resources.
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Ukrainian
    Text: "\u0423 \u043A\u043E\u0436\u043D\u043E\u0457 \u0441\u0432\u043E\u0457 \u0440\u0435\u0441\u0443\u0440\u0441\u0438."
    Object: {fileID: 0}
  - Language: Spanish
    Text: Cada uno tiene sus propios recursos.
    Object: {fileID: 0}
